objective:
本課程將導入解決企業實務問題為導向設計課程單元。課程中將教授沈浸式互動體驗設計 (MR) 以及服務機器人學習的撰寫與技術。並要求各小組利用這些技術為服務零售企業主規劃設計完善的服務與零售行銷流程，以達到實際解決服務與零售企業的實務問題。再者，本課程也利用商業影音個案方式學習服務業管理與行銷的概念與實務，因此本課程將會使用電腦影音設備以幫助同學更快速地融入行銷專業英文的學習情境。同學每週將會觀看，撰寫心得並研討一個服務業商業影音個案。藉此強化同學學習效果.
This course will introduce a curriculum focused on solving real-world business challenges. Students will learn immersive interactive experience design (MR) and programming techniques for service robotics. Each team will be tasked with applying these technologies to develop comprehensive service and retail marketing strategies for service-oriented retail businesses, addressing practical issues faced by these enterprises. The course is designed to:
1.	To help students be familiar with knowledge of service management;
2.	To revisit every theory and concept learned in service management through case studies;
3.	Strengthen students' practical insight and make successful service management and marketing.
This course will play business case videos for students' discussion and learning. Therefore, the course will require using the Internet and computers to search for information.
